{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_011Ch3neXD32G9kxtqjuWV23","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added the invoices export and committed the script and its output as `9a599c5`. I left January as it was.\n\nThe export follows the customers export, with one change: it also leaves out invoices belonging to segment C customers. Commit `0fc0fe3` says segment C customers declined partner sharing and that \"nothing about them goes to the partner… every record we hold on them, not only this table.\" The invoices table has no segment column, so `scripts/export_invoices.py` looks up each invoice's `customer_id` in `tables/customers.csv` to find its segment.\n\nI ran it: `out/invoices.csv` has 8 of the 12 source invoices. The 4 left out belong to customers 103 and 105, the same two removed from the customers export.","citations":[]}],"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-5.5","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":234,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":18085,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":251,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"},"provider":"Anthropic","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<uuid-1>","uuid":"<uuid-40>","timestamp":"2026-11-15T00:44:10.902Z","request_id":"gen-1794703447-w2xw9Eemyuhzb2WykXIN"}
